  "assessments": [
    {
      "requirement_id": "Q01",
      "assessment": "Actual weighted/unweighted SES groups and missingness verified. Every sealed result also has independently counted pupils and schools per contrast component and PV; insufficient support is a separate reporting restriction, never a deleted target or fabricated missing source. Coverage is not a missing-at-random or representativeness claim.",
