    },
    {
      "requirement_id": "Q06",
      "assessment": "User decision 19 October: admission is per age-domain combination with three comparable waves. Full selected-combination focus anchors and jointly selected series/peer definitions are enforced; membership is fixed within a figure and may differ between figures. Equal-country means and ranks are numerically tested. Empty references stay empty; no benchmark/rank CI or group rank line.",
